cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "WFile Asia Public Notice Dataset"
version: 1.1.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24503671"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://wfile.org/data/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/adnxx1wsx/wfile-open-data"
authors:
  - name: "WFile Editorial Team"
    website: "https://wfile.org"
abstract: >-
  Article metadata for multilingual public-interest coverage from Japan, Korea,
  Thailand, Vietnam, and Indonesia, published by WFile in Japanese, Korean,
  Thai, Vietnamese, Indonesian, and English. The dataset contains article
  titles, summaries, canonical URLs, publication dates, topics, and links to
  the original public sources. Full article text is not included.
keywords:
  - multilingual news
  - Asia
  - public information
  - Japan
  - Korea
  - Thailand
  - Vietnam
  - Indonesia
  - open data
